WEBVTT

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.129
Hi, friends. Gani here. This is Goal Setting Ladder.

00:00:13.129 --> 00:00:18.257
Sit tall in your chair. Feet flat on the floor.

00:00:18.257 --> 00:00:21.334
Hands resting on your desk. Shoulders soft.

00:00:21.334 --> 00:00:24.411
Take one slow breath with me… and let it go.

00:00:24.411 --> 00:00:31.591
Think of something you would love to be able to do. Something big. Maybe it feels far away.

00:00:31.591 --> 00:00:39.797
Big things are not climbed in one jump. They are climbed like a ladder — one small rung at a time.

00:00:39.797 --> 00:00:49.028
A goal ladder starts with the big thing at the top. Then we look for the very first rung, down low.

00:00:49.028 --> 00:00:53.131
The first rung is always small. Small enough to stand on today.

00:00:53.131 --> 00:01:02.362
Rung one: name the goal. Say it plainly, in your own words. It is yours — nobody picks it for you.

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:11.594
Rung two: find the first tiny step. Not the whole climb. Just the first little thing.

00:01:11.594 --> 00:01:20.825
Rung three: do that one small thing today. One rung. That is enough for one day.

00:01:20.825 --> 00:01:29.030
Then look up. The next rung shows itself after you are standing on this one.

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:30.056
Your ladder is yours alone. It is never lined up next to anyone else's.

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:38.262
Some days a rung feels wobbly. Some days you miss one, or you need to stay where you are and rest.

00:01:38.262 --> 00:01:47.493
Resting on a rung is allowed. A ladder holds you while you rest. That is what it is for.

00:01:47.493 --> 00:01:55.699
A wobbly rung is not a broken ladder. It is information: maybe the next step needs to be smaller.

00:01:55.699 --> 00:01:56.724
Small steps still count. Small steps are how every big thing ever got climbed.

00:01:56.724 --> 00:02:03.904
Name the goal. Find the first tiny step. Do that one today.

00:02:03.904 --> 00:02:09.033
Shoulders soft. Let your body rest.

00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:13.136
Hands down. One more slow breath… and let it go.

00:02:13.136 --> 00:02:18.264
Eyes open. Look around your classroom.

00:02:18.264 --> 00:02:23.393
You're ready for what's next.
